"text": "Taskbar frozen? Don't restart your PC.\nPress Control, Shift, Escape to open Task Manager.\nFind Windows Explorer, and select it.\nClick Restart task.\nThe taskbar comes back in a second, and your apps stay open.\nFollow for more Windows fixes."
